The same three-phase model continues to improve under repeated, bounded profile refinement without changing phase identity or fractions. The independently verified \(R_\mathrm{wp}\) has reached 3.24%, and the next pass is converging the correlated size/strain terms; all refined values remain inside the laboratory’s stated physical ranges.

